Package: PhyloFlow
Title: Convert Dendritic River Networks into Phylogenetic Trees
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael W.", "Sandel", , "evozoa@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts dendritic river networks into rooted phylogenetic
    trees for use as null hypotheses in phylogeographic research. Sample
    collection sites are snapped to a stream network (either user-supplied
    or fetched from the National Hydrography Dataset), and the connecting
    network is converted into a tree whose branch lengths reflect stream
    segment lengths. Also computes pairwise along-stream distances between
    sites, optionally weighted by stream attributes, for isolation-by-distance
    analyses.
